                                                "sense_id": "fd6b9fa2-c048-35fb-91ad-e07b39adc525",
                                                "text": "Bikepacking, as the name implies, is a harmonization of backpacking and cycling that is typically synonymous with a lightweight setup for touring, often off-road. Both ultralight touring and bikepacking are based on the principle that less is more."
                                            },
